§§ `Article 18 — claims`

GIVEN `age evidence`      IS A BOOLEAN
      `age proved before` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `The claim documents`
`claim documents, age evidence` `age evidence` `, age proved before` `age proved before` MEANS
    `The claim documents` WITH
        `the policy contract`                     IS TRUE
        `the completed claim forms`               IS TRUE
        `evidence of the claimants' relationship` IS TRUE
        `evidence of the insured event`           IS TRUE
        `evidence of the Life Insured's age`      IS `age evidence`
        `age already proved to the Company`       IS `age proved before`

