GIVEN `the claim date`      IS A DATE
      `days lost`           IS A NUMBER
      `learned`             IS A MAYBE DATE
GIVETH A `A claim for a benefit`
`a claim for an event on 1 March 2030, made on` `the claim date` `, days lost` `days lost` `, learned` `learned` MEANS
    `A claim for a benefit` WITH
        `date of the insured event`                         IS YMD 2030 3 1
        `date the claim was made`                           IS `the claim date`
        `days of force majeure or other objective obstacle` IS `days lost`
        `date the Policyholder learned of the event, if the Policyholder proves not knowing of it` IS `learned`

